ss to this dataset on request for non-commercial purposes.\totherRestrictions\tData may be re-used under the terms of the 3rd Party Open Data licence. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Floodplain Meadows Partnership Information © Floodplain Meadows Partnership and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tThird Party Open\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS121851\tBritish Geological Survey (BGS): Mineral Resources (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by the British Geological Survey. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances.  However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© British Geological Survey NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement: British Geological Survey BGS Digital Data under Licence Number 2013/062 ©NERC; Contains Ordnance Survey Data. Ordnance Survey Licence number AC0000849444. Crown Copyright and Database Right\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS119283\tSustrans: The National Cycle Network (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Sustrans Cymru. The data is to be used only for the agreed purpose and is not to be published or used otherwise without Sustrans\u0027 express permission.\totherRestrictions\t© Sustrans Cymru NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement: © Sustrans Cymru and Ordnance Survey.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS120174\tDefra: National Atmospheric Emissions Inventory (NAEI) (3rd party data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by DEFRA. NRW may provid