ed to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© RSPB 2006                                                                    NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement:  Data reproduced with the permission of RSPB.   © Crown Copyright. Ordnance Survey licence number 100021787 (2018)\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS120645\tNetwork Rail: Level Crossings (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Network Rail. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW.\totherRestrictions\t© Network Rail. Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and owners copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution Statement: Information provided by Network Rail - https://www.networkrail.co.uk/transparency/datasets/\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS161308\tUK Centre for Ecology and Hydrology (UKCEH): Land Cover Map 2022 (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\t\tThis dataset is wholly owned by UKCEH. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances. However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\trestricted\t© UKCEH. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly.\t© UKCEH\tThird Party Conditional\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS121553\tEuropean Environment Agency (EEA): CORINE Land Cover (CLC) 2012 - Peat and Urban (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\