pyright and Database Right\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS120801\tPlantlife International: Important Arable Plant Area Data for Wales (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Plantlife International. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances.  However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© 2017 Plantlife International. All Rights Reserved. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. The Plantlife logo must be included in all publications and one copy of all publications and reports using data supplied by Plantlife International shall be supplied free of charge to Plantlife International.  Attribution Statement: Copyright © 2018 Plantlife International. All Rights Reserved.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS121883\tMet Office: Average Rainfall (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by the Met Office and is for internal business use only. Enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© The Met Office NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly.\t© Crown Copyright 2011, The Met Office\tNot Licenced for Re-use\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS121874\tForestry Commission England (FCE): Forest Recreation (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by The Forestry Commission. There are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\totherRestrictions\t© The Forestry Commission. Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Governme