ity to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS125471\tSurvey and Monitoring of Epiphytic Lichens around PAWS Sites in Brechfa Forest\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tAccess restrictions on this data have not been determined. It may contain sensitive information and therefore may be restricted under legislation. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however NRW may not release, publish or disseminate the data or derived products freely without further assessment.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS161285\tWater Framework Directive (WFD) Management Catchments Cycle 3\totherRestrictions\tnoLimitations\tThere are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW All rights Reserved. Contains Ordnance Survey Data. Ordnance Survey Licence number AC0000849444. Crown Copyright and Database Right. Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and copyright of the owners. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved. Contains Ordnance Survey Data. Ordnance Survey Licence number AC0000849444. Crown Copyright and Database Right.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tValid\tGEMINI\nEXT_DS121623\tNational Trust: Neptune Coastline Campaign (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis data is wholly owned by the National Trust. There are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\totherRestrictions