t the NRW metadata entry or data custodian for the data for copyright statement Details will differ depending on individual cases.  Staff should consult the NRW metadata entry or data custodian for the data for restrictions and advice\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS111769\tSite Actions held in the Integrated Sites Information System (ISIS) Database\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tParts of this dataset are sensitive and restricted. Access to this data may be restricted under relevant legislation. Access to the dataset is available to approved members of NRW staff and to users of the extranet under NRW licence. Levels of access is dependent on the type of stakeholder e.g. organisations with many actions will be granted full extranet access under licence, whilst other interested individuals will be able to access shared maps and unit reports with permission of relevant landowner.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW Data may be re-used under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS110029\tSite Condition Assessments of Welsh Standing Water Features (2003 - 2008)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThere are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW  Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and NRW\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS110070\tAcross Wales Drop-Down Video Monitoring 2007 - 2010\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tPart of this dataset is sensitive and restricted. The sensitive data is as follows; Ostrea edulis and Palinurus elephas. Sensitive data must be kept confidential; general release is not permitted due to risk of harm to the environment or third parties. Sensitive data may only be released under an appropriate NRW Licence. Requests should be referred to NRW\u0