ce on interpretation should be sought where required. To avoid re-using old data, users should periodically obtain the latest version from the original source.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\t\t\t\tValid\tMEDIN\nNRW_DS114859\tNatural Resources Wales (NRW) Regional Data: South East Wales (South East Wales Biological Records Centre - SEWBReC)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\t- NRW Regional Data: South East Wales Sensitive Species Records NRW is legally obliged to give public access to the data and information which it holds unless specific legal exceptions apply, for example, if the data is personal or if release of the data would result in environmental harm. This dataset contains only sensitive species records for which detailed location data is restricted. Sensitive data may be made available under licence to approved individuals and organisations on request. It is provided under strict confidentiality terms.   - NRW Regional Data: South East Wales Non-sensitive Species Records The Intellectual Property Rights (including copyright and database rights) to the collation and all records created by NRW staff or contractors are owned by NRW. Where individual records were created by a third party, the copyright to that record rests with the original recorder/surveyor.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW  - NRW Regional Data: South East Wales Sensitive Species Records NRW is legally obliged to give public access to the data and information which it holds unless specific legal exceptions apply, for example, if the data is personal or if release of the data would result in environmental harm. This dataset does not contain any sensitive species.   - NRW Regional Data: South East Wales Non-sensitive Species Records The Intellectual Property Rights (including copyright and database rights) to the collation and all records created by NRW staff or contractors are owned by NRW. Where individual records