uare). -Crayfish Palinurus elephas (below 10km square). -Seahorse Hippocampus guttulatus (below 10km square). -Short snouted seahorse Hippocampus hippocampus (below 10km square). -Oyster bed habitat IMX.Ost (biotope code) (below 20km square). NRW may NOT publish or disseminate the sensitive data. Requests should be referred to NRW\u0027s Access to Information Officer. However, there are no access restrictions on non-sensitive data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate a redacted version of the data freely.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW 2013 recipients may only re-use sensitive data in strict confidence under the terms of an appropriate NRW Licence or equivalent. No publication or dissemination is permitted, except if sensitive records are removed in advance, or shown only at a coarser scale. A redacted version of the data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and NRW\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tValid\t-\nEXT_DS123552\tEnvironment Agency: Coastal Flood Boundaries (CFB) publication 2018 - England and Wales (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Environment Agency NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW.\totherRestrictions\t© Environment Agency Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution statement: Contains Environment Agency information © Environment Agency and database right.\tContains Environment Agency informatio