e) or contact the Plant Protection team at least 14 days in advance.  Information Warning: This data is supplied by National Grid on a best-effort basis only, using available information as documented at the time by the transmission network operators. While every effort is made to make sure the information is accurate and up-to-date, National Grid do not accept any liability for any direct, indirect, or consequential loss or damage of any nature--however caused--which may be sustained as a result of reliance upon such information\totherRestrictions\t© National Grid UK NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement: \"© National Grid UK\"\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS122590\tSurvey of Invasive Non-Native Species (INNS) at Welsh dredge disposal sites:  Milford Haven and the Severn Estuary 2018\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThere are no access restrictions on this data. NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and NRW\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution statement: Contains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nEXT_DS119070\tWelsh Government: Agricultural Land Classification (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Welsh Government. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances.  However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© Crown Copyright: Welsh Government. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to 