ation © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved. Contains Ordnance Survey Data. Ordnance Survey Licence number AC0000849444. Crown Copyright and Database Right.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tValid\tGEMINI\nEXT_DS119298\tOffice of National Statistics (ONS): Built Up Areas (3rd Party Data)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThis dataset is wholly owned by Office of National Statistics. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW.\totherRestrictions\t© Office of National Statistics (ONS) Data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and owners copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose. Attribution Statement: Contains National Statistics data © Crown copyright and database right [2015]\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS123367\tAll Wales Hydrological Analysis Catchments\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tAccess restrictions on this data have not been determined.  It may contain sensitive information and therefore may be restricted under legislation.  NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however NRW may not release, publish or disseminate the data or derived products freely without further assessment.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW Data may only be re-used externally under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence following an assessment of the data.\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS123446\tNRW Flood duty officer areas\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tAccess restrictions on this data have not been determined.  It may contain sensitive information and therefore may be restricted under legislation.  NRW may provide access to this dataset on request, however NRW may not release, publish or disseminate the data or derived products freely without further assessment.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW 