y. If a NRW Contractor requires any of the LPIS layers please contact the Data Services team who will contact Welsh Government to request permission. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly. Attribution Statement: © Crown copyright: Welsh Government\t\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS98737\tPhase 2 Lowland Peatland Survey of Wales\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tPart of this dataset (habitat data) has no access restrictions and NRW may release, publish or disseminate it freely. However part of this dataset is sensitive and restricted as it contains data exempt from general release. The sensitive data is as follows; 1) Plant species listed on the NRW Sensitive Species List. This may only be released at a scale 10km sq. 2) Personal data e.g. names and addresses, other personal details. This information will not be released without permission of those involved 3) Sensitive site data, e.g. information about a site prior to designation. 4) Data with a landowner interest e.g. if a landowner specifically objects to information about their property being released Sensitive data must be kept confidential; general release is not permitted due to risk of harm to the environment or third parties.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate the full dataset. A redacted version of the data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and NRW\u0027s copyright. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved. Contains Ordnance Survey Data. Ordnance Survey Licence number AC0000849444. Crown Copyright and Database Right.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tValid\tGEMINI\nNRW_DS124808\tNRW Industry