tValid\tGEMINI\nNRW_DS115838\tTowed Video Surveys off the Coastline of the Llyn Peninsula North Wales (2013)\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tPart of this dataset is sensitive and restricted. Sensitive data must be kept confidential; general release is not permitted due to risk of harm to the environment or third parties. Sensitive data may only be released under an appropriate NRW Licence. Requests should be referred to NRW\u0027s Access to Information Team. Data may be released freely if the sensitive records are removed in advance, or shown only at a coarser scale.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW. Non-sensitive data may be re-used under the terms of the Open Government Licence providing it is done so, acknowledging both the source and copyright of the owners. Recipients may only re-use sensitive data in strict confidence under the terms of an appropriate NRW Licence. No publication or dissemination is permitted, except if sensitive records are removed in advance, or shown only at a coarser scale. It is the recipient\u0027s responsibility to ensure the data is fit for the intended purpose.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tOpen Government Licence\t\t\tValid\tMEDIN\nNRW_DS124884\tNRW Woodland Names\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tAccess to this data may be restricted under relevant legislation. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate the data. Requests should be referred to NRW\u0027s Access to Information Officer.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tNot Licenced for Re-use\t\t\tValid\t-\nNRW_DS114339\tIntertidal Monitoring of Rockpools, Caves and Overhangs in Carmarthen Bay and Estuaries Special Area of Conservation (SAC) 2008\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tThe following data is considered