ned by L. Dudley Stamp/Geographical Publications Ltd, Audrey N. Clark and the Environment Agency that digitised the collection. NRW may provide access to this dataset on request in some circumstances. However, enquirers are advised to obtain a copy from the owner/originator directly, rather than NRW. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate it in its entirety.\totherRestrictions\t© L. Dudley Stamp/Geographical Publications Ltd, Audrey N. Clark, Environment Agency/DEFRA and Great Britain Historical GIS. NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate this dataset. Those seeking such permission should approach the originator directly.\t© L. Dudley Stamp/Geographical Publications Ltd, Audrey N. Clark, Environment Agency/DEFRA and Great Britain Historical GIS\tNot Licenced for Re-use\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS125452\tAuthorised Landfill Sites Points\totherRestrictions\tno limitations\tPart of this dataset is sensitive, and access may be restricted under relevant legislation. NRW may NOT publish or disseminate the sensitive data. Requests should be referred to NRW\u0027s Access to Information Officer. However, there are no access restrictions on non-sensitive data. NRW may release a redacted version of the data.\totherRestrictions\t© CNC/NRW NRW does NOT grant permission to third parties to re-use or disseminate the full dataset. A redacted version of the data may be re-used under provision and in line with the terms of a NRW licence.\tContains Natural Resources Wales information © Natural Resources Wales and Database Right. All rights Reserved.\tNRW Conditional\t\t\tValid\tGEMINI\nNRW_DS161368\tGeomorphological Surveys to Support the Upper Wye Restoration Project\totherRestrictions\t\tReplace this text with the Access Constraints statement\totherRestrictions\tReplace this text with the Use Constraints statement\tReplace this text with the Attribution Statement\t\t\t\tUnknown\t-\nNRW_DS161279\tKiEco Freshwater Ecology: River Macrophytes - Geospatial\tother